       - Redundant (3+1) 700/1000 Watt Power Supplies
       -  700 Watts at 100V to 120V: 50/60Hz, 90/132 VAC
       - 1000 Watts at 208V: 50/60 Hz, 185/264 VAC

* Availability 
       - Redundant (3+1), hot-plug Power Supplies
       - Redundant, hot-plug Cooling Fans
